---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { getEmDashCollection } from "emdash";
import { getCloudflareStreamUrl } from "../components/blocks/videos";
import images from "../components/blocks/images";

const { entries: allVideos, cacheHint } = await getEmDashCollection("videos", { limit: 100 });
try { Astro.cache.set(cacheHint); } catch {}

const dojoVideos = allVideos.filter(v => v.data.category === "dojo-training").slice(0, 4);
const testimonialVideos = allVideos.filter(v => v.data.category === "shiatsu-testimonial");
---

<Base
  title="指圧整体院"
  description="泰山流指圧整体院 — 武道の知識と経験を活かした独自の指圧療法。身体のバランスを整え、自然治癒力を高める東京八王子の治療院。"
>

  <!-- ヒーローセクション -->
  <section class="sh-hero">
    <img
      src="https://pub-488a24026ed4411b8d591260b603cdd1.r2.dev/shiatsu/SHIATSU_DO_02.webp"
      alt="泰山流指圧整体院"
      class="sh-hero-bg"
    />
    <div class="sh-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="sh-hero-content">
      <p class="sh-eyebrow">Taizan-ryu</p>
      <h1 class="sh-hero-title">
        <span class="line-a"><span class="ja">指圧</span><span class="en">Shiatsu</span></span>
        <span class="line-b"><span class="ja">整体院</span><span class="en">Clinic</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="sh-hero-sub"><span class="ja">武道の知で、身体を癒す。</span><span class="en">Healing the body through martial wisdom.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-hero-scroll">
      <span></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 説明セクション -->
  <section class="sh-desc surface-dark">
    <div class="sh-inner">

      <div class="sh-intro reveal">
        <h2><span class="ja">泰山流指圧について</span><span class="en">About Taizan-ryu Shiatsu</span></h2>
        <p class="ja">
          泰山流指圧は、宗家ジョー・ミラーが柔術修行の中で体得した皇法指圧を礎に、
          独自の研究と改良を加えて生み出した指圧療法システムです。
          武道で培った身体の理解と、経絡・ツボへの深い知識を組み合わせ、
          心身のバランスを整え自然治癒力を引き出します。
        </p>
        <p class="en">
          Taizan-ryu Shiatsu is a therapy system developed by Soke Joe Miller,
          building upon Koho Shiatsu he mastered during his ju-jutsu training,
          enhanced through his own research and refinements.
          It combines deep body awareness cultivated through martial arts with
          profound knowledge of meridians and pressure points to restore balance and unlock natural healing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="sh-pillars">

        <div class="sh-pillar reveal">
          <span class="sh-pillar-num">01</span>
          <div class="sh-pillar-body">
            <h3><span class="ja">皇法指圧との融合</span><span class="en">Fusion with Koho Shiatsu</span></h3>
            <p class="ja">八光流柔術に組み込まれた皇法指圧を源流に持ちます。伝統的な手技の本質を受け継ぎながら、より効果的な施術を追求しました。</p>
            <p class="en">Rooted in Koho Shiatsu incorporated into Hakko-ryu Ju-jutsu. While inheriting the essence of traditional hand techniques, we pursued more effective treatment methods.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sh-pillar reveal">
          <span class="sh-pillar-num">02</span>
          <div class="sh-pillar-body">
            <h3><span class="ja">泰山流独自の手技</span><span class="en">Taizan-ryu Original Technique</span></h3>
            <p class="ja">母指先端ではなく母指付け根全体を使う独自のストローク技術。多くのクライアントから「痛みが少なく、深く効く」と好評を得ています。</p>
            <p class="en">A unique stroking technique using the full base of the thumb rather than its tip. Praised by many clients as "less painful and deeply effective."</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sh-pillar reveal">
          <span class="sh-pillar-num">03</span>
          <div class="sh-pillar-body">
            <h3><span class="ja">統合的な治療アプローチ</span><span class="en">Integrated Treatment Approach</span></h3>
            <p class="ja">皇法・泰山流・浪越指圧の各システムを症状に応じて使い分け。武道で鍛えた身体感覚が、的確なアプローチを可能にします。</p>
            <p class="en">Applying Koho, Taizan-ryu, and Namikoshi Shiatsu systems according to the condition. The body awareness developed through martial arts enables precise application.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- 宗家の言葉 -->
  <section class="sh-quote surface-white">
    <div class="sh-inner">
      <blockquote class="reveal">
        <h2><span class="ja">泰山流指圧について</span><span class="en">About Taizan-ryu Shiatsu</span></h2>

        <h3><span class="ja">泰山流指圧の誕生</span><span class="en">Birth of Taizan-ryu Shiatsu</span></h3>
        <p class="ja">
          私は柔術の師である奥山龍峰宗家代から初めて皇法指圧を学びました。
          奥山宗家は八光流柔術という護身術システムの創始者であり、このシステムには皇法指圧システムが武道の一部として組み込まれていました。
          1985年、私は皇法治療の技術を自分自身の経絡とツボへの応用アイデアと融合させ、異なるレベルの施術を実現したいと考えました。
        </p>
        <p class="en">
          I first learned Koho Shiatsu from my ju-jutsu teacher, Soke Okuyama Ryuho.
          Soke Okuyama was the founder of Hakko-ryu Ju-jutsu, a self-defense system that incorporated
          the Koho Shiatsu system as part of the martial arts. In 1985, I wanted to blend
          the techniques of Koho treatment with my own ideas for applying meridians and pressure points,
          and to achieve different levels of treatment.
        </p>

        <h3><span class="ja">独自のシステム開発</span><span class="en">Development of Our Own System</span></h3>
        <p class="ja">
          皇法指圧は深く根差した母指圧ですが、人々は母指の先端での施術の痛みに耐えられませんでした。
          そこで私は母指の付け根全体を使い、異なるストローク技術を適用することにしました。
          多くのクライアントで実地試験を行ったところ、肯定的なフィードバックを得られ、多くの人がこのプロセスを愛していると言ってくれました。
          最終的に、私は泰山流指圧システムを米国議会図書館に著作権登録しました。
        </p>
        <p class="en">
          Koho Shiatsu uses deep-rooted thumb pressure, but people could not tolerate the pain
          of treatment with the tip of the thumb. So I decided to use the entire base of the thumb
          and apply different stroking techniques. After field-testing on many clients, I received
          positive feedback — many people said they love the process. Eventually, I registered
          the Taizan-ryu Shiatsu system with the Library of Congress.
        </p>

        <h3><span class="ja">現在の治療アプローチ</span><span class="en">Current Treatment Approach</span></h3>
        <p class="ja">
          今日、私はこの応用原理を使ってクライアントの健康を改善しています。
          異なる疾患には皇法指圧システムを引き続き使用することもありますが、
          両方のシステムに加えて浪越指圧システムの応用を組み合わせることで、
          特定の症状を持つ方々の治療においてより良い結果を得ています。
        </p>
        <p class="en">
          Today I use these application principles to improve my clients' health.
          For different conditions I may still use the Koho Shiatsu system, but by combining
          both systems along with the Namikoshi Shiatsu system, I achieve better results
          in treating people with specific conditions.
        </p>

        <h3><span class="ja">指圧の歴史的背景</span><span class="en">Historical Background of Shiatsu</span></h3>
        <p class="ja">
          指圧は日本で生まれた非侵襲的な指圧療法です。
          当時、このタイプのセラピストは「按摩さん」と呼ばれており、これはマッサージ師を意味します。
          これらのセラピストの多くは視覚障害者でした。
          なぜなら、これは彼らが見ることなくできる数少ない仕事の一つだったからです。
          触れることだけが、彼らの唯一の生計手段でした。
        </p>
        <p class="en">
          Shiatsu is a non-invasive pressure therapy born in Japan. At the time,
          this type of therapist was called "Amma-san," meaning massage therapist.
          Many of these therapists were visually impaired, because this was one of the few
          occupations they could perform without sight. Touch alone was their sole means of livelihood.
        </p>

        <footer><span class="ja">— 宗家　ジョセフ・ミラー</span><span class="en">— Soke Joseph Miller</span></footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 指圧認定証セクション -->
  <section class="sh-certs surface-dark">
    <div class="sh-inner">
      <div class="sh-section-header reveal">
        <h2><span class="ja">指圧認定証</span><span class="en">Shiatsu Certifications</span></h2>
        <p class="ja">宗家ジョセフ・ミラーの指圧資格証明書</p>
        <p class="en">Soke Joseph Miller's Shiatsu Certification</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sh-cert-grid reveal">
        <img src={images.certificate1} alt="指圧認定証 1" />
        <img src={images.certificate2} alt="指圧認定証 2" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 宗家の著書セクション -->
  <section class="sh-books surface-white">
    <div class="sh-inner">

      <div class="sh-section-header reveal">
        <h2><span class="ja">宗家の著書</span><span class="en">Soke's Publications</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="sh-book-row reveal">
        <div class="sh-book-image">
          <img
            src={images.shiatsuTextbook1}
            alt="Healing Touch: The Complete Guide"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="sh-book-text">
          <p class="sh-book-label"><span class="ja">著書</span><span class="en">Publication</span></p>
          <h3 class="sh-book-title">Healing Touch: The Complete Guide</h3>
          <p class="sh-book-subtitle"><span class="ja">泰山流指圧・整体のガイドブック</span><span class="en">A Guide to the TaizanRyu System of Shiatsu and Seitai</span></p>
          <p class="sh-book-desc ja">
            宗家ジョセフ・ミラーによる、60年以上の武道経験に基づいた泰山流指圧の包括的なガイドブックです。伝統的な日本の治療芸術と現代的なアプローチを融合させ、心身の健康を取り戻すための実践的な知識が詰まっています。
          </p>
          <p class="sh-book-desc en">
            Discover the secrets of TaizanRyu Shiatsu in this comprehensive guide by Soke Joseph Miller. Drawing from over 60 years of martial arts experience, this book bridges traditional Japanese healing arts with practical application.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/Healing-Touch-Complete-Mr-Miller/dp/1798760118"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="sh-amazon-btn"
          >
            <span class="sh-amazon-icon">&#9654;</span>
            <span class="ja">Amazonで購入する</span><span class="en">Buy on Amazon</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- 治療院お客様の声セクション -->
  <section class="sh-testimonials surface-light" id="testimonials">
    <div class="sh-testimonials-wrap">

      <div class="sh-inner">
        <div class="sh-section-header reveal">
          <h2><span class="ja">治療院お客様の声</span><span class="en">Client Testimonials</span></h2>
          <p class="ja">施術を受けたお客様の体験談を動画でご紹介します。個人の感想であり、効果を保証するものではありません。</p>
          <p class="en">Video testimonials from clients who have received treatment. These are personal experiences and do not guarantee outcomes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sh-testimonial-grid-wrap">
        <div class="sh-testimonial-grid">
          {testimonialVideos.map((v, i) => (
            <div class="sh-testimonial-item reveal" style={`animation-delay: ${(i % 3) * 100}ms`}>
              <div class="sh-testimonial-video">
                <iframe
                  src={getCloudflareStreamUrl(v.data.cloudflare_video_id, false, Number(v.data.thumbnail_time))}
                  title={v.data.title_jp}
                  allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                  allowfullscreen
                ></iframe>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  /* ===== 共通 ===== */
  .sh-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  /* ===== ヒーロー ===== */
  .sh-hero {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100vh;
    min-height: 600px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sh-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .sh-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0%,
      rgba(30, 20, 10, 0.7) 100%
    );
  }

  .sh-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .sh-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: shFadeUp 0.8s ease 0.2s forwards;
  }

  .sh-hero-title {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .line-a {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: shFadeUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0.4s forwards;
  }

  .line-b {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: shFadeUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0.6s forwards;
  }

  .sh-hero-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: shFadeUp 0.8s ease 0.9s forwards;
  }

  .sh-hero-scroll {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 40px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .sh-hero-scroll span {
    display: block;
    width: 1px;
    height: 60px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), transparent);
    margin: 0 auto;
    animation: shScrollLine 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes shFadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @keyframes shScrollLine {
    0%   { transform: scaleY(0); transform-origin: top; opacity: 1; }
    50%  { transform: scaleY(1); transform-origin: top; opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: scaleY(1); transform-origin: top; opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* ===== 説明セクション ===== */
  .sh-desc {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .sh-intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 80px;
  }

  .sh-intro h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .sh-intro p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .sh-pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sh-pillar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 48px 36px;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .sh-pillar:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .sh-pillar-num {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  /* ===== 指圧認定証セクション ===== */
  .sh-certs {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .sh-cert-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .sh-cert-grid img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 6px;
    filter: grayscale(15%);
    transition: filter 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .sh-cert-grid img:hover {
    filter: grayscale(0%);
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .sh-cert-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* ===== 宗家の著書セクション ===== */
  .sh-books {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .sh-book-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sh-book-image img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  }

  .sh-book-text {
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .sh-book-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .sh-book-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--text-on-light);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .sh-book-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(107, 31, 35, 0.4);
    padding-left: 12px;
  }

  .sh-book-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .sh-amazon-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    background-color: #FF9900;
    color: #111;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .sh-amazon-btn:hover {
    background-color: #e88800;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .sh-amazon-icon {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .sh-book-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .sh-book-image img {
      max-width: 220px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: block;
    }
  }

  .sh-pillar-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .sh-pillar-body p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* ===== 宗家の言葉 ===== */
  .sh-quote {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .sh-quote blockquote {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sh-quote blockquote br {
    display: none;
  }

  .sh-quote blockquote h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: #1e0e08;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    padding-bottom: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(58, 42, 32, 0.2);
  }

  .sh-quote blockquote h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    color: #2a1a10;
    margin-top: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-left: 14px;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(107, 31, 35, 0.5);
  }

  .sh-quote blockquote h4 {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #5a3a2a;
    margin-top: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .sh-quote blockquote p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 2.1;
    color: #3a2a20;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .sh-quote blockquote footer {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(58, 42, 32, 0.15);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #7a5a4a;
    text-align: right;
  }

  /* ===== 動画セクション ===== */
  .sh-videos {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
  }

  .sh-section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .sh-section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .sh-section-header p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sh-video-grid {
    display: grid;
